===Demonic Pacts===
Our new Combat Mastery system gives you way more flexibility with what combat styles you want to specialise in as the Demonic Pacts form a skill tree, something we're trying for the very first time!

[[File:Leagues VI- Demonic Pacts - Launches Today! (3).png|thumb|600px|center|If you can't see the asset above, [https://cdn.runescape.com/assets/img/external/oldschool/2026/Newsposts/2026-04-08/DP-Tree.png click here].]]

While your first point will be spent on the centre pact during the tutorial, from this point on you may branch out however you please, providing that you have unlocked a previous node connected to it. You'll have a total of '''40 points''' to spend if you gain them all from the specific tasks that give them and you have up to '''3 full tree resets''', by defeating your first three unique Echo Bosses and earn yourselves those sweet, sweet resets.

If you want a helping hand on you build, our friends over at the OSRS Wiki have created a fantastic [https://tools.runescape.wiki/demonic-pacts Demonic Pacts Calculator] which also works with their DPS Calculator! Alongside this, we've teamed up with Faux, Sardaco, Zizaran & JonMP4 to give you a couple of recommended build for you to try!

