'''Note:'''

* Kourend: "Equip a piece of Radiant Oathplate" is now "Equip a full set of Oathplate armour"
* Asgarnia: "Defeat the Awakened Whisperer" is now "Equip a pair of Avernic Treads (max)"

These two tasks stood out as the most 'skill-check' options where your additional power from Demonic Pacts and Relics isn't likely to be a difference maker like it is in many other Pact tasks, so we've brought them more in line with other tasks which can be reliably stat-checked by players with powerful builds, even though some of these tasks may still be more of a grind than others in spots!

===Echo Bosses===
Theses fearsome versions of iconic bosses return this leagues and while you'll be familiar with all but one of the bosses themselves, the rewards have been reworked to directly work with the Demonic Pacts to help amplify your build.

Battle the original version of the boss for a chance to score an Echo Orb, which will let you fight the more powerful variant, giving you a chance to come away with their exclusive items. All areas aside from Karamja have Echo Bosses, so you'll have a choice of 4 Echo Bosses you can face-off against this time around.

We worked with the wonderful Scritic to create a video all about this league's Echo Bosses and Items, so check it out for more info!

