===New Starting Location & Area Unlocks===
The systems aren't the only things changing this league as you won't be starting in Misthalin for the very first time, in fact, Misthalin is not even available to visit at all! Instead you'll being your journey in a unique version of Yama's Lair and then right after the tutorial you can head into the Shining Kingdom itself, '''Varlamore!'''

This presents another twist on leagues most staple version by kicking things off in the most recently released region, which has plenty of content to get lost in! Once you've got your first area unlock, you'll automatically unlock Karamja, with the next three being up to you. Make sure to keep in mind what relics and Pacts you're choosing as theses areas can really make the difference.

What's nice this time around is all areas have the same amount of total points, which gives everyone racing for those top spots, some more freedom!

But when can you unlock your areas? Well that will depend on the ''amount'' of tasks you complete:

* Varlamore - 0 tasks
* Karamja - 80 tasks
* Area Choice #1 - 200 tasks
* Area Choice #2 - 350 tasks
* Area Choice #3 - 450 tasks

As an extra bit of information for you Wilderness pickers, we've moved Krystilia into Ferox Enclave to help with Slayer!

